# A hit without an attacker (the fire bombs of a trapped book read in the
# Avatar's own pack: fire and blunt, 20 to 32) is softened by the armour
# as in the original; before, 31 points killed the armoured Avatar at once
# (the cheat's magic shield keeps the fire part off)
args: --cheat
do: t2;hit:1,31,C;t1;hp
expect: actor 1: hp 25 dex 15 side 2 enemies 0
